    \n        code_for_constraint: \".hasPattern('date', r'^\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\\
    d{2}$')\"\n\n  - name: \"Ensure toss_winner is one of the playing teams (team1\
    \ or team2)\"\n    input: {}\n    expected:\n      must_include_constraint:\n\
    \        column_name: \"toss_winner\"\n        code_for_constraint: \".satisfies(\\\
    \"toss_winner = team1 OR toss_winner = team2\\\", 'toss_winner_in_teams', lambda\
    \ v: v == 1.0)\"\n```"
